diff --git a/pi/naviGATR/PIPELINE.md b/pi/naviGATR/PIPELINE.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6051477
--- /dev/null
+++ b/pi/naviGATR/PIPELINE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,109 @@
+# naviGATR pipeline
+
+## Goal
+
+naviGATR answers two questions for the Brain: where am I, and where are things
+around me. Most of the time the point is to line up relative to something on
+the field, not to know absolute field truth.
+
+- Localization answers "where am I": a robot pose from wheels and IMU.
+- World estimation answers "where are things around me": each field object's
+  error from where the map says it is.
+- They meet in one place only. Turning a relative observation into a field
+  position goes through the robot pose, so shared localization error cancels
+  when lining up relative to a landmark. See
+  [world_estimation](src/pipeline/world_estimation/PIPELINE.md).
+
+## Stages, in run order
+
+Every stage folder has the same shape: `PIPELINE.md`, `contract.h` (the
+standard in/out), `stage.h/.cpp` (its `make_*` builder, when it has one), and
+its plug-ins in a named subfolder.
+
+| # | Stage | In | Out | Plug-ins |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | [resources](src/pipeline/resources/PIPELINE.md) | `<Resources>`: devices, links, geometry | ResourceStore, ResourceMap | `cameras/`, `tag_detectors/`, `pico/`, `links/`, `geometry/`, `synthetic/` |
+| 2 | [sensors](src/pipeline/sensors/PIPELINE.md) | ResourceMap | SensorMap | `channels/` |
+| 3 | [commands](src/pipeline/commands/PIPELINE.md) | Brain requests | CommandState | `collectors/` |
+| 4 | [localization](src/pipeline/localization/PIPELINE.md) | SensorMap, placement | RobotState, pose history | `observation_models/`, `estimators/` |
+| 5 | [world_estimation](src/pipeline/world_estimation/PIPELINE.md) | SensorMap, RobotState, pose history, previous field | FieldState, observations, associations | `estimators/` |
+| 6 | [targets](src/pipeline/targets/PIPELINE.md) | command, robot, field, evidence | TargetState | `resolvers/` |
+| 7 | [publishing](src/pipeline/publishing/PIPELINE.md) | everything above | Brain replies | `publishers/` |
+
+- Build: [src/core/build.cpp](src/core/build.cpp) `System::build` calls each
+  stage's `make_*` (or slot factory) in this order. Any failure discards the
+  whole system; nothing partial runs.
+- Run: [src/core/run.cpp](src/core/run.cpp). Build vs run:
+  [src/core/PIPELINE.md](src/core/PIPELINE.md).
+- Stage machinery (registry, typed payloads, records, ids):
+  [src/pipeline/framework/](src/pipeline/framework/).
+- With `<BrainProfile>`, sensors and localization are built later from the
+  robot profile the Brain sends: [src/brain_profile/](src/brain_profile/),
+  [docs/brain_profile.md](docs/brain_profile.md).
+
+## Threads and rates
+
+| Thread | Runs | Rate |
+|---|---|---|
+| estimation worker | resources, sensors, commands, localization, then targets and publishing against the newest field snapshot | `<Loop rate_hz>`, 100 Hz in the robot configs |
+| field worker | world estimation on the newest SensorMap copy; a newer one replaces a pending one (latest wins, [handoff.h](src/core/handoff.h)) | at most the loop rate, slower when detection is slow |
+| main thread | Brain profile swaps, event log lines (worker mode) | every 20 ms |
+| inspection service | reads snapshots only | per client, `state_hz` 30, `preview_hz` 5 by default |
+| capture recorder | drains the diagnostics hub | every 20 ms |
+
+- Inputs: Pico frames at 50 Hz, Brain GET_STATE every 20 ms, camera frames as
+  libcamera delivers them.
+- `--inline`: every stage on one thread through `step()`, for tests and replay.
+- One writer per state: the estimation worker owns resources through
+  localization and the command/target state, the field worker owns the field,
+  localization's feed is the only history writer.
+
+## Adding a plug-in
+
+1. Implementation in the stage's plug-in folder, e.g.
+   `src/pipeline/world_estimation/estimators/<group>/`.
+2. One `registerOrDie` line in that stage's `register_*.cpp`.
+3. Sources in `NAVIGATR_SOURCES` ([CMakeLists.txt](CMakeLists.txt)); tests in
+   [tests/](tests/) and [tests/CMakeLists.txt](tests/CMakeLists.txt).
+4. Select it in XML by `type`.
+
+No change to `core/` or to the stage builder.
+
+## Other folders
+
+| Folder | What |
+|---|---|
+| [src/main.cpp](src/main.cpp) | parse args, build, run |
+| [src/cli/](src/cli/) | command-line parsing |
+| [src/core/](src/core/PIPELINE.md) | the engine: builds the pipeline and runs it |
+| [src/pipeline/](src/pipeline/) | the stages, `register_all` |
+| [src/brain_profile/](src/brain_profile/) | Brain-driven reconfiguration: profile build and swap, CONTROL, Pico operations, sensor loss, recovery, stationary precheck |
+| [src/config/](src/config/) | XML reading, file composition, field map parser |
+| [src/io/](src/io/) | serial ports, byte streams, half duplex |
+| [src/time/](src/time/) | host clock, clock sync, time types |
+| [src/math/](src/math/) | transforms, SE(3), quaternions, camera model, units |
+| [src/debug/](src/debug/) | `inspection/` service, `capture/` recorder, `diagnostics/` hub and events |
+| [spectaGATR/](spectaGATR/) | browser viewer |
+| [config/](config/) | XML configurations |
+| [tools/](tools/) | field_refs generator, camera calibration, perf, viewer tests |
+| [tests/](tests/) | host tests |
+| [docs/](docs/) | details: [architecture](docs/architecture.md), [coordinates](docs/coordinates.md), [landmarks](docs/landmarks.md) |
+
+## Season-specific
+
+Nothing under `src/` knows the game. Plug-ins are sensor-specific, not
