+  landmarks, tag mounts, boundary, collision boxes, wire ids. Sources:
+  [docs/field_assets.md](docs/field_assets.md).
+- [config/override/](config/override/): this season's robot configs (Brain
+  profile over USB or RS-485, `diagnostics/` bench and bring-up profiles).
+- [config/shared/robots/](config/shared/robots/): this robot's geometry and
+  camera.
+- Target sets (`target_set` resource), when used: XML only.
+- `brain/operaGATR/include/field_references.h`: generated from `field.xml` by
+  [tools/field_refs/](tools/field_refs/) (`field_references` build target).
+
+A new season is a new field file, a regenerated field_references.h and new
+configs. A new sensor is a new plug-in, not a pipeline change.
