+# commands
+
+What the Brain wants. One slot, `<CommandCollection type>`.
+
+- In: the previous `CommandState`, host time.
+- Out: `CommandState` ([command_state.h](command_state.h)): Brain session,
+  newest placement, profile status, reported path, target selection, the reply
+  owed this cycle. No update carries the previous state forward.
+- Contract: [contract.h](contract.h) `Commands`, `CommandsMakeFunction`.
+- No stage builder: [core/build.cpp](../../core/build.cpp) builds the slot.
+
+Plug-ins: `collectors/` (`brain_link`, `noop`), registered in
+[collectors/register_commands.cpp](collectors/register_commands.cpp). A
+`brain_link` collector needs the `brain_link` publisher on the same serial
+link.
+
+Add one: a `Commands` implementation in `collectors/`, a line in
+`register_commands.cpp`, the source in CMake.
