@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+# localization
+
+Where am I. Wheels and IMU in, one robot pose out.
+
+```text
+SensorMap -> observation models -> RobotObservationMap -> one estimator
+          -> settle accepted/rejected -> RobotState + pose history
+```
+
+- In: `SensorMap`, `LocalizationRequests` (placement from the Brain or the
+  configured `InitialPlacement`).
+- Out: `RobotState` ([robot_state.h](robot_state.h)): odometry pose, field
+  anchor, velocity, yaw rate, validity, attitude; localization status; pose
+  history. Readers use `RobotStateFeed` ([robot_state_feed.h](robot_state_feed.h)),
+  the only history writer.
+- Contract: [contract.h](contract.h) `RobotObservationFunction`,
+  `StateEstimator` and their make functions.
+- Builder: [stage.h](stage.h) `make_localization`.
+- Here at stage level: robot state, feed, pose history, attitude, stillness,
+  observation payloads, [register_localization.cpp](register_localization.cpp).
+
+Plug-ins:
+- `observation_models/` (`<Observation type>`): `tracking_wheel_motion`,
+  `imu_heading_increment`, `attitude_reference`, `brain_imu_planar_bench`,
+  `brain_imu_parallel_bench`; `stationary_window` is their shared bias and
+  stillness helper.
+- `estimators/` (`<Estimator type>`, exactly one): `planar_motion_integrator`,
+  `weighted_planar_fusion`, `noop`; `motion_step` holds their shared rules.
+
+Add one: the class in its folder, a line in `register_localization.cpp`, the
+source in CMake.
+
+With `<BrainProfile>` this subtree is generated from the Brain's robot
+profile ([src/brain_profile/](../../brain_profile/)). Details:
+[docs/architecture.md](../../../docs/architecture.md#localization),
+[docs/localization_fusion.md](../../../docs/localization_fusion.md).
