+# publishing
+
+What leaves the Pi. One slot, `<Publishing type>`. Wire formats, wire ids and
+fixed-point units live here, never in the states being published.
+
+- In: `PublishingInput`, every product of the cycle: SensorMap, observations,
+  associations, robot state, localization status, field, command, target.
+- Out: Brain replies on the link; status; the `brain_state` block for
+  inspection.
+- Contract: [contract.h](contract.h) `Publishing`, `PublishingMakeFunction`.
+- No stage builder: [core/build.cpp](../../core/build.cpp) builds the slot.
+
+Plug-ins: `publishers/` (`brain_link`, `noop`), registered in
+[publishers/register_publishers.cpp](publishers/register_publishers.cpp).
+`brain_link` answers only a request its collector left pending, once;
+`field_documents` builds the field map and estimate documents it serves.
+
+Add one: a `Publishing` implementation in `publishers/`, a line in
+`register_publishers.cpp`, the source in CMake.
