@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# resources
+
+Opens devices and loads static data once at build; polls the devices once per
+estimation cycle.
+
+- In: `<Resources>`, one `<Resource id type>` each.
+- Out: `ResourceStore` (initialized objects bound directly by id: links,
+  cameras, detectors, field map, geometry) and `ResourceMap` per cycle
+  (`ResourceMap[resource_id].outputs[output_id]`).
+- Contract: [contract.h](contract.h) `ResourceExecutable`; factory signature
+  `ResourceMakeFunction` in [resource_store.h](resource_store.h).
+- Builder: [stage.h](stage.h) `make_resources`.
+- Here at stage level: the shared device and data contracts other stages bind
+  to (`camera.h`, `tag_detector.h`, `pico_control.h`, `wheel_geometry.h`,
+  `robot_frames.h`, `target_set.h`, ...).
+
+Plug-ins, by family: `cameras/`, `tag_detectors/`, `pico/`, `links/`,
+`geometry/`, `synthetic/`. All registered in
+[register_resources.cpp](register_resources.cpp).
+
+Add one: a factory in its family folder (a new family folder if none fits), a
+line in `register_resources.cpp`, the source in CMake, an entry in
+[docs/navigatr_resources.md](../../../../../docs/navigatr_resources.md).
