@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# sensors
+
+Turns raw resource outputs into usable measurements: wire units to SI,
+electrical signs, mount corrections, or a plain forward.
+
+- In: the whole `ResourceMap`, read-only, bound at build by (resource id,
+  output id) and payload type.
+- Out: `SensorMap[sensor_id]`, a `MeasurementRecord` each: typed sample,
+  health, measured and received time, sequence, epoch, provenance.
+- Contract: [contract.h](contract.h) `SensorExecutable`, `SensorMakeFunction`.
+- Builder: [stage.h](stage.h) `make_sensors`.
+- Here at stage level: the SensorMap payloads (`sensor_samples.h`,
+  `attitude_samples.h`, `camera_frames.h`) and `sensor_catalog.h`.
+
+Plug-ins: `channels/` (`pico_encoder_channel`, `pico_imu_channel`,
+`camera_frame`, `attitude_channel`), registered in
+[channels/register_sensors.cpp](channels/register_sensors.cpp).
+
+Add one: a factory in `channels/`, a line in `register_sensors.cpp`, the
+source in CMake, an entry in
+[docs/navigatr_sensors.md](../../../../../docs/navigatr_sensors.md).
