+# apriltag estimator
+
+One camera, AprilTags on field objects. `<Estimator type="apriltag">`.
+
+```text
+SensorMap -> ObservationExtraction -> tag observations        (published)
+          -> Association           -> pose evidence, trace    (published, optional)
+          -> LandmarkEstimation    -> FieldState
+```
+
+| Step | File | In | Out |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| extraction | [apriltag_tag_observation.h](apriltag_tag_observation.h) | new frames of the configured camera, the detector resource | `tag_observations.h`: canonical tag poses in the camera frame |
+| association | [tag_mount_association.h](tag_mount_association.h) | tag observations, robot pose and attitude at exposure, camera mount, tag mounts, gates | `FieldObjectPoseEvidenceSet`; `tag_association_trace.h` for inspection |
+| landmarks | [../../landmark_estimator.h](../../landmark_estimator.h) (generic) | pose evidence | committed `FieldState` |
+
+- Wiring and config: [apriltag_world_estimator.h](apriltag_world_estimator.h).
+- Without `<Association>` the observations still publish (camera inspection)
+  and `<LandmarkEstimation commit="never">` is required.
+- A step fault leaves the previous field untouched and publishes nothing.
+- Details: [docs/landmarks.md](../../../../../docs/landmarks.md).
